sentences.text:
(i) Products are shown as being "by Modicare";
(ii) The Maximum Retail Price (hereinafter, MRP) of the products is first scaled up and then reduced to the actual MRP, which is in violation of the Legal Metrology Act,
2009 and the Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodity) Rules, 2011 as amended by Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Amendment Rules, 2017.
